window.products.push({"id":649121,"name":"Empire Art Direct Homme 3 Mixed Media Iron Hand Painted Dimensional Wall Art, 48\" x 32\" x 2.2\", Ready to Hang (PMO-120708-4832)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":184.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWOqIGoNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EADEmpire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948.At EAD, we are proud to be creating perfect decorative products on the market.Our decorations are over 1, 000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorations for all moments in your life.Feature:• Item Name: Empire Art Direct Homme 3 Mixed Media Iron Hand Painted Dimensional Wall Art, 48\" x 32\" x 2.2\", Ready to Hang• Model Name: Homme 3• Color: Multi Color• Style: Industrial• Material: Metal• Technics: Each piece is inspected and certified by the artist as an original work of art• Packing: Packing with bubble wrap and protective corners in carton• Product Size & Weight: 48\"L x 32\"W x 2.2\"D & 17.2 lbs• Package Size & Weight: 51.6\"L x 35.8\"W x 2.6\"D & 19.2 lbsDecoration:This is another intriguing work in the Picasso style and continues Primo's tradition of giving the viewer many angles and ways of seeing his art. He places a focus on creating different ways of looking at the same piece so that viewers can maintain their own perspective of the piece, rather than look at a picture and know exactly what it is. Primo accomplishes this with his interesting mixed media wall sculpture vision and distinct creative style. Each piece is hand signed by the artist.About returns policy and our services:If you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services.Check out our brand Empire Art Direct for more choices!ORDER NOW!DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UWOqIGoNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B00Y2K6CJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y2K6CJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y2K6CJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
