window.products.push({"id":649126,"name":"Hyoola Tall Taper Candles Bulk - 12 Inch Light Pink Unscented Dripless Taper Candles - 10 Hour Burn Time - 100 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rVylKBFPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY TALL CANDLES BULK Need something to illuminate your decor at your special occasion? Look no further than our tall taper candles unscented by Hyoola. They exude a warm glow and a long-lasting flame. Our tapered candles in bulk are designed well and will fit in most standard-sized candle sticks holders. Made of 100% high-quality paraffin wax, our long candles are dipped in layers, for a beautiful smooth finish. Our 100% cotton wick ensures a long-lasting, even burn. PRODUCT FEATURES: 100% Paraffin Wax 100% Cotton Wicks Over Dipped for Smooth Finish Dripless Unscented Made in Europe Perfect for Restaurants, Weddings, and Parties. 3 Sizes: 10” - 8 Hour Burn Time12” - 10 Hour Burn Time14” - 12 Hour Burn Time Available Colors: White, Ivory, Cream, Dark Grey, Woolwhite, Antique Rose, Taupe, Celery Green, Burgundy, Sahara, Turquoise, Terra Orange, Midnight Blue, Fuchsia, Lime, Black, Metallic Gold, Metallic Silver, Metallic Copper, Light Pink, Mauve Pink, Purple, Grey Blue, Ice Blue, Yellow, Orange, Cherry Red, Olive Green, Sage Green, Silver Grey MULTIPURPOSE USE Hyoola’s taper candles bulk 100-pack equip you for any occasion, whether it be a wedding or celebration, religious observance, and more. Their elegant tapered shape, makes them perfect for church prayers, and other religious rituals as well. Why Are My Tapers Candles Dripping? The candle might not be completely vertical. If your taper candle isn't standing straight, it will burn unevenly, which can lead to wax running far down the long candle before it hardens.  There could be a draft, air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft, as well as a slight breeze, can also cause the candle stick to burn unevenly and lead to dripping. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Dripless Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility that will brighten your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rVylKBFPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B097Q7NKD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097Q7NKD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097Q7NKD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
