window.products.push({"id":649196,"name":"SEI Gel Fuel Fireplace, Electric, Mahogany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EdfmZqEUL._AC_SL1238_.jpg","description":"A wonderful arrangement of classical style, the Raphael Carved Fireplace is a uniquely ornate. The wonderful carved design starts with a floral motif and continues to the curling columns along the side. With a high style that even the masters of old would enjoy, this piece stands apart as a truly elegant piece. A gel fuel fireplace has all the benefits of a wood burning fireplace with none of the mess Gel fuel is the ideal replacement for wood in your fireplace. Our gel fuel snaps and crackles just like a real fire should, but leaves no smoke or odor. Each can lasts up to 3 hours on a single burn and puts off up to 3,000 BTU. Our gel fuel fireplaces can hold up to 3 cans at a time for a full bodied flame. Must be purchased separately. Includes metal firebox, cement log, faux coal cinder and screen kit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EdfmZqEUL._AC_SL1238_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEI","source_asin":"B000XPZAXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000XPZAXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000XPZAXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649197,"name":"Vietnamese cooking utensils khuon banh gio, Vietnamese cookware steamed cake mold pyramidal rice dumpling, banh gio mold assist the baker to shape the","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofmBg8PoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PACKAGE INCLUDES:  1 big banh gio mold.  1 small banh gio mold.  Made in: Vietnam.  Banh gio is always a favorite breakfast of every Vietnamese family. If you have not seen the detailed and simple banh gio recipe, please follow the recipe below. Clumsy is also successful with banh gio mold.  1. How to make banh gio crust  - Mix 2 liters of bone broth with 400g of rice powder, 100g of flour, 2 tablespoons of cooking oil, stir to dissolve the flour. If the powder is thick, add 200ml of water. Soak the flour for 4 hours. Cook the dough over medium heat, stirring constantly until you see the mixture boil and start to thicken and smooth, you turn off the heat.  2. How to make inside the banh gio  Add shiitakes + wood ear fungus + dried onion + ground lean meat + prepared spices for the cake in the bowl. Mix it all up. The filling is made into round balls, about the size of a small tangerine and then steamed.  3. How to package and steam the banh gio  - Banana leaves are washed and drained.  - Arrange banana leaves in a small banh gio mold or big khuon banh gio (depending on your preference), then scoop 1 teaspoon of flour into the leaf funnel and add the cake filling.  - Scoop 1 teaspoon of flour on top, spread this flour evenly to cover the filling. Seal the cake by folding the leaves from all four sides. Use cotton to tie the cake.  - Pour 1.5 liters of water into the steamer to boil, heat the steamer. Then put in the banh gio, boil the steamer for 20-30 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofmBg8PoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TJ-Store","source_asin":"B08KQ94DF6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KQ94DF6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KQ94DF6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
