window.products.push({"id":649254,"name":"Mohawk Home Doorscapes Riviera Tiles Mat, 1'6x2'6, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1CAouMHdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vibrant Moroccan inspired tiles enliven the face of our Riviera Tiles doormat. A fresh palette of tropical hues, spiced with shades of sunset orange, clear sky blue, blazing red, deep teal and avocado, illuminates the eclectic artistry. An ecofriendlly option, the Riviera Tiles is consciously constructed with the smooth touch of our recycled polyester flock and backed by the durability of our recycled rubber. In 2009, Mohawk Home diverted over 18 million pounds of rubber tires, one of the largest and most hazardous types of post consumer wastes, from landfills and brought them to homes as designer doormats. Our recycled rubber doormats have a high definition decorative, top surface design made of a flock and heat transfer. These durable mats have an innovative scraping surface that cleans shoes while hiding dirt in recessed channels. The slip resistant surface repels water, which is great for traction in all weather conditions. With this gorgeous contemporary style and medallion print, this welcome mat's pile height is 0.25 in high. Remember to keep the pile and fabrics in tip top shape. Clean with vacuum or shake out. Spot clean as needed. Only the best quality materials will do. This mat is printed on 100% recycled polyester flock face using a flock heat transfer, backed with 100% recycled rubber. Made in USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1CAouMHdFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mohawk Home","source_asin":"B010SMMCCI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010SMMCCI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010SMMCCI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
