window.products.push({"id":649288,"name":"3M Adhesive Hooks, Heavy Duty Waterproof Towel Hooks 304 Stainless Steel, Metal Hangers Hooks on Wall Home Office Bathroom Kitchen for Keys Bags Coat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXOyrEgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgrade Comparison 1. Self-adhesive hooks. Install easy, without assistance of glue, no drilling nor screws, reduce the cumbersome steps of installation. 2. No marks hooks, you don't have to worry about wall damage caused by unscrewing surface screws or installation problems. 3. The hook is installed with high quality 3M adhesive. Without worrying about falling off at any time. 4. It does not fall or slide as easily as a suction cup. Stable and Durable Towel Hooks Metal hooks made of 304 stainless steel and having been brushed paint, it resists corrosion, no rust, ensuring durability and reliability. Will never corrupt after long time use, even in damp bathroom. Applicable Surface Stylish hanging hooks are suitable for smooth surfaces such as tiles, wood, glass, mirrors, etc. Please do not stick it to plaster wall. Otherwise, it won't be firm. Wide Application Ideal for bedrooms, bathrooms, living room, closets, cabinet, wardrobes, kitchen, cabinets, office, etc. Multi purpose hooks for towels, hats, robe, dress, coats, bathrobes, keys, umbrellas, decoration, handbag, saving backpacks, clothes, etc. How to install the stainless steel hook on the wall? 1. Clean and dry the surface of the hook that will be secured. 2. Remove the protective film, stick the hook to the wall surface and press it with your hand to make sure it is strong. 3. To ensure better adhesion, it is recommended to heat the adhesive with a blower before installation. Use self-adhesive hooks after 24 hours of installation. 4. Self Adhesive Hooks can be removed by a knife after heated by a hair dryer, leaving no residue. Box Contains: 2 * Stainless Steel Hooks (with 3M adhesive)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uXOyrEgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BowJet","source_asin":"B07VM7YHQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VM7YHQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VM7YHQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
