window.products.push({"id":649291,"name":"6pcs Plastic Squeeze Condiment Bottle 32oz with Twist Cap for Mustard Dressing Ketchup BBQ Sauce Mayonnaise Syrup, Condiment Containers Clear No Leak ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TnuwnLbjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"OUTSTANDING CONTAINER WITH ANTI LEAK CAP – Our 6 plastic squeeze condiment bottles come with the anti mess lids so you won't experience leaky lids when squirting your favorite sauce or ketchup. Unlike those who give separated tip caps, we provide you with a snapped on cap attached to the lid to avoid losing no more. FANTASTIC MULTIPURPOSE – Each kitchen squeeze bottle has a capacity of 24oz, giving you more than enough space to store kitchen condiments like ketchup, mustard, bbq sauce, olive oil, and mayonnaise. Wanna go picnic? Take the lid off and cover the hole with plastic wrap for easy sauce transport. No more spilling sauce until you get to your destination. NOT LIMITED TO CONDIMENTS – Not only works as a sauce squeeze bottle or mustard bottle, you can use it as a pancake syrup squeeze bottle to form a unique pancake shape. Use this condiment bottles to put honey, maple syrup, or chocolate for pancake's topping. Put the vinaigrette inside this oil bottle for salad dressing. What's more? you can store the leftover wine for cooking. PERFECT BOTTLE FOR ARTWORK - Let's make some arts and craft! Use this plastic squirt bottles to store wall paint for graffiti, acrylic paint for tie-dye, colored sand for sand art, or even a simple colored glue for your kids' paper art. Unleash your creativity and have a good time doing artwork with your kids. VERSATILE BOTTLE FOR EVERY NEED – Storing condiments, toppings, pancake batter, salad dressing, and even paints or glue for making some crafts, what makes you hesitate to buy this versatile condiment squeeze containers? ORDER NOW or you will regret it later.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TnuwnLbjL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfecto","source_asin":"B081GXN3YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081GXN3YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081GXN3YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
