window.products.push({"id":649300,"name":"ZEXVIDA Small Side Table for Small Spaces,3 Tier Slim End Table with Metal Ledge Tray Design,Narrow Thin End Table Bedside Table, Small Nightstand for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hhkHGa4DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect for Small Spaces】 Dimensions: 24'' H × 13.4' L × 11'' W/61cm(H) *34cm(L) *28cm(W). Rustic end table with shelf,3 tiers design can help storage more essentials of your living room bedroom or office; This versatile end table can serve as a side table next to your couch, a storage unit, a bedside table, a reading nook, a corner table, a tea or snack station, a display platform, or even a laptop workspace. It's perfect for adding functionality to various spaces, such as bathrooms, hallways, living rooms, bedrooms, offices, and more. 【All-match Classic Appearance】The combination of retro wood grain panels and black painted metal, this low-key modern industrial style makes it perfectly integrated into any interior decoration style. This modern industrial style magazine side table is very suitable for your bedroom or living room, looks elegant and generous, and adds a touch of industrial style to your home. 【Sturdy & Stable Construction】 The robust mix of sturdy iron and hard-wearing engineered wood gives the industrial nightstand a high degree of stability. Load the surface with items up to 100 lb, the storage shelf up to 50 lb, which can put magazines, books or a variety of other items on them. The board surface is made of high-quality retro-style MDF board(Eco-friend and durable). The metal frame of the round end table table is made of top high-density steel. We built a perfect balance from retro minimalism beauty and overall stability within this side table. 【Space Saving & Multi-Use】You can put it in many places as a sofa side table, bedside table, porch nightstand, farmhouse end table for your bedroom, living room, entryway, hall etc. Some say it could also be good as a plant stand!!! 【Ample Storage Space】This versatile small end table is a must-have for any space-conscious shopper. With dimensions of 13.4\"(L)*11\"(W)*24\"(H), it offers ample storage space to keep your living area clutter-free. This industrial-style accent table is perfect as a sofa end table, nightstand or placed in a corner. Though compact, it has plenty of space for a lamp, drink, and magazines on the top panel. The lower storage compartment is perfect for tidying away phone remote controls and other small items, while the wooden rack at the bottom is ideal for storing books, papers, or magazines. Don't let limited space hold you back - this small end table is the perfect addition to your home. 【Easy To Assemble】All tools and accessories you need for this tall end table are included. Plus the clear manual, you could easily assemble them in 20 minutes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hhkHGa4DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEXVIDA","source_asin":"B0BTYQS9YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649300","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTYQS9YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTYQS9YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
