window.products.push({"id":649463,"name":"CraftsOfEgypt Handwoven Egyptian Tribal Kilim Rug Wool – Handmade Runner Kilim Rug with Bright, Vivid Colors – Made","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gvQyHb1lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MORE COLOR AND STYLE FOR ALL YOUR ROOMS High Quality Natural Handwoven Rug Do you feel your rooms are rather dull and need something to brighten them up? Or maybe you are looking for a quality rug to replace your old one? Whatever your needs, CraftsOfEgypt handwoven kilim rug is just what you need. It is a bright rug with brilliant designs that are sure to add life to any room and create a nice contrast with your existing décor. It is also made from 100% animal wool, this is a high-quality piece that you will own for years to come. Great for All Your Needs While rugs are typically used as floor coverings, you can use this Egyptian rug for more than just that. It is perfect as a top for your bedside table, and will look excellent on your walls too. You are really not limited in what you can use it for. Handmade by a local village This Kilim rug is made in the village of Fowa, located on banks of the Nile River in Egypt. Handwoven on a loom and finished with hand-knotted fringe. Reversible for twice the wear. May be rinsed with cold water and mild soap. Allow rug to dry flat before use Reasons you should get this flatweave runner kilim rug: Made of 100% wool, no artificial fabric Made of 100% wool, no artificial fabric Bright and vivid colors will not fade Bright and vivid colors will not fade Handwoven for extra quality Handwoven for extra quality Perfect for any room or use Perfect for any room or use You get a 100% money back guarantee You get a 100% money back guarantee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gvQyHb1lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CraftsOfEgypt","source_asin":"B005AK929U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005AK929U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005AK929U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649464,"name":"HIC Porcelain Sushi Platter 16- by 8.5-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DF15-n1DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful whitewares are versatile. They go with any décor and they spotlight your culinary creations. When you spend so much time preparing attractive and colorful snacks and dinners don’t lose them to pattern and color – place those carefully prepared sushi rolls, wasabi and ginger on a blue plate and you’re sure to stifle the delight and wonder of your well thought out and prepared meal. Frame your food with beautiful whiteware and put the spotlight on the food, itself. HIC’s porcelain Sushi Platter will do just that. It is made of porcelain, but don’t let that scare you, because this platter is extremely durable. Take it with you, wherever you want and need it. It is oven, microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. Bring your culinary masterpiece, beautifully framed in HIC porcelain, from the kitchen to your guests and your guests will see and taste the difference. 16 X 8.5”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DF15-n1DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIC Kitchen","source_asin":"B000UT7CKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UT7CKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UT7CKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
