window.products.push({"id":649516,"name":"Gener8 Pink Camo Metal/Vinyl Table & Chairs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w7jvpu9OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Use this durable painted metal frame table set for your child's crafting projects and other activities. Vinyl table tops and chair seats and backs offer an easy-to-clean surface that holds up to your child.Pink table and two chairs with camouflage pattern for kids ages 2 and upTable and chairs both feature painted metal frames for added durability and stability Printed camouflage pattern vinyl on the tabletop, seat bottom and seat back is easy to cleanAssembly requiredAssembly Required","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w7jvpu9OL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gener8","source_asin":"B0180SO680","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0180SO680","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0180SO680","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649517,"name":"EZ Melon Stainless Steel Watermelon Slicer - Melon and Cantaloupe Fruit Slicer, Carver, Cutter, Knife - Carving and Cutting Tools for Home, Profession","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Sa7bz3hML._AC_.jpg","description":"Tired of slicing your fruits into uneven cubes? Everybody loves watermelons, melons and cantaloupes especially in the summertime. But these huge fruits require effort to cut, especially since you can slice them in so many ways: into cubes, rounds, wedges—you name it! If you enjoy these fruits on almost a daily basis, you know that the whole process of cutting them alone is arduous enough. Enjoying a refreshing fruit salad shouldn't mean enduring the hassle of cleaning up sticky surfaces and utensils! With EZ Melon’s Stainless Steel Watermelon Slicer, you get evenly cut cubes in a matter of seconds! No more removing the watermelon or melon from its rind or uneven cutting slices through the fruit. With this remarkable find, all you need to do to enjoy it is to push the tool in, remove and indulge. Whether for personal enjoyment or a group get-together, you will find this item to be very useful. And if you like making snacks for your young ones, vitamin-packed melon and watermelon can finally become go-to, healthy snacks. Plus, it’s mess free! Even when you get close to the rind, juices won't puddle around your fruit. You still get to enjoy bite-sized pieces without having to undergo extensive clean up. Here are more reasons to love this stainless steel fruit slicer: ✅ No more need to try different methods of cutting ✅ Just throw in the dishwasher or hand wash ✅ Say goodbye to messy hands,fingers, palms ✅ No more countertops dripping in a sea of sticky juices Take your cutting to a whole new level. Add EZ Melon’s Stainless Steel Watermelon Slicer to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Sa7bz3hML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lux&Max","source_asin":"B07P5FHZPV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P5FHZPV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P5FHZPV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
