window.products.push({"id":649548,"name":"Bialetti Aeternum Red 7312 Cookie Sheet, Large, 11-inch x 17-inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VmYjgJEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the perfect layered cake with this Aeternum 9-inch Round Cake pan from Bialetti. The Aeternum bakeware collection features durable, heavy-gauge aluminized steel construction and a red, high-temp non-stick exterior making it the ideal piece to go from kitchen to table. The bakeware's white ceramic interior is designed for easy release and better browning. This earth-friendly pan is PTFE, PFOA, and Cadmium-free, and unlike other nonstick bakeware, Aeternum's nonstick coating will not become absorbed in your food. Large handle design provides better control and a secure grip for ease of use. Made of heavy gauge steel and is oven safe up to 400-degrees F. With Aeternum ceramic coating, always use a little oil or butter when baking foods. For best results, hand wash with non-abrasive cleansers and liquid dishwashing soap. Use only nylon, wood, or high temperature silicone tools. In order to guarantee the best performance, avoid sharp pointed metal utensils that could scratch or ruin the nonstick surface. Do not use knives or small appliances such as electric mixer to chop or mix food if your cookware. Such use can damage the interior surface and void the warranty. Bialetti began in Italy, but has become a leading brand around the world for its high-quality products bringing simplicity, functionality and beauty to the kitchen. Bialetti's advanced technology and distinctive styling combine to create cookware that's simple to use and simply beautiful. Bialetti is authentically Italian, where the kitchen is the heart of the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VmYjgJEbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bialetti","source_asin":"B00LHT6N22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LHT6N22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LHT6N22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
