window.products.push({"id":649776,"name":"CHYIR Candy Silicone Molds & Ice Cube Trays,2 Pack Gummy Worm Molds 20 Cavities with Bonus Dropper (Red, Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vZzv4GdKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY SILICONE BEAR MOLDS: Made of food grade silicone .Easy to clean, safe for oven, freezer and dishwasher. Heat resistant up to -40F to 450F. These molds are great for making candy or chocolate. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL: With our high quality silicone bear molds you can easily make any treat you want. Perfect to make gummy worms, chocolate treats, candy worms, jelly, Ice cubes and mix your own ingredients for a healthy alternative snacks. EASY TO FILL & CLEAN: Comes with a dropper for easy fill, featured with non-stick silicone makes gummy bears pop out easily without cracking with detail face and cuddly arms. Easy to fill, easy to use & easy to clean. SMALL BUT ENOUGH: Set of 2 x 20 cavities with 2 dropper, can make 40 gummy worms at one time. The size of each tray is 9.6 inches x 7 inches x 0.4 inches. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We support a full 30-DAYs MONEYBACK GUARANTEE policy. Have any issues, questions, concerns, or comments? Please feel free to contact us via email and we will gladly assist you. Your complete satisfaction is a top priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vZzv4GdKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHYIR","source_asin":"B07QQXDSX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649776","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QQXDSX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QQXDSX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649777,"name":"SONIVE Bedding Duvet Cover Set Super Soft and Breathable Double Brushed Microfiber 3 Pieces with Zipper Closure 8 Corner Ties (White, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pf0uOcsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Woven from 100% microfiber of good quality, this duvet cover set features a great performance of breathability, moisture-wicking and free from odor,creating a dry, cool and comfortable sleeping environment. The fabric is double brushed on both sides for ultimate softness and a snuggly touching feel. The durable fiber can withstand constant washing without pilling or losing shape.Best way to keep your comforter clean. CORNER TIE & ZIPPER CLOSURE: Exquisite workmanship with the best stitching process you can find! 50-65 inches zipper closure makes it simple and convenient to change the duvet insert. Four corner ties and extra four ties hold the insert tightly in place and prevent it from shifting. So you never have to wake up in the middle of the night once again to fix the duvet cover. King size includes 1 104x90 inch Duvet Cover and 2 20x26 inch Pillow Shams. ELEGANT COLOR & DESIGN: This duvet cover set combines the classic color and elegant design with hidden zipper closure & envelope pillow shams, adding a fabulous décor to your bedding and perfectly fitting your traditional, modern, natural, and different kinds of bedroom styles. The ideal choice for bedrooms, kids' rooms, teen rooms, guest rooms and vacation houses for all seasons! Best gift for families and friends. EASY CARE: This Duvet cover is wrinkle-free, shrinkage and fading-resistant and less likely to have stain, pills or static than cotton. Machine washable in cold water, tumble dry low and iron on low temperature. Please close the zipper completely to prevent snags and tears during laundering. CUSTOMER SERVICES: We create a cozier home for you with our 50 years' experience in textiles. We would like to hear your voice at any time. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions or needs. We will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pf0uOcsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonive","source_asin":"B093SNQ5C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093SNQ5C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093SNQ5C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649778,"name":"TreeBud Macrame Dream Catcher Handmade Woven Wall Hanging Decoration Boho Home Decor for Kids Room Wedding Ornament Craft Gift (Moon)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dyPWqStuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Handmade Decoration - TreeBud Dreams Dream Catcher for Wall Hanging Ornament Dreamcatcher originated in the North American tribe formerly known as the Ojibwa nation. It is said that both good dreams and bad dreams circulate in the night air. by hanging a Dream Catcher over or around your sleeping area, the bad dreams will be deterred by the beads in the catcher and the feathers will attract and allow the good dreams to pass through. IN native american culture，a dream catcher is a handmade object based on a willow hoop, on which is woven a loose net or web.There's a lot of meaning in the dream catcher: their shape is the circle of life and according to some legends, the beads represent the spider who wove the dream catcher. ♥ Features: 1. Our dream catcher is pure handmade. Each process is woven by a worker who has had many years of weaving experience, and only skilled workers can weave such a uniform, perfect and rhythmic grid; 2. Beige cotton rope shows its unique shape through different weaving methods, which makes Dreamcatcher unique 3. Because of its beautiful design and symbol, both adults and children will enjoy with it; 4. The dream catcher feather mobile waves beautifully and quietly in the air, it will not disturb you and it will pray for peace and good luck with you. ♥ Note: Our dream catchers are pure handmade, so it is purely normal if there is little difference between each one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dyPWqStuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeBud","source_asin":"B087X9V6ZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087X9V6ZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087X9V6ZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
