window.products.push({"id":649836,"name":"Remington RM1300 Mulchinator 3-in-1 12 Amp Electric Blower/Mulcher/Vacuum-Lightweight 2 Speed-10:1 Debris Reduction-Attachable Rolling Nozzle-2 Stroke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":175.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knFEyBJDL._AC_SL1205_.jpg","description":"The Remington RM1300 Mulchinator 3-in-1 2 Speed 12 Amp Electric Blower Mulcher Vacuum is a high performance machine with a 12 Amp electric motor that moves air at speeds up to 150 mph and air volume up to 350 cfm moving even the most stubborn yard waste. Two speeds, low and high, give you more control between blowing dry leaves and debris in larger areas such as driveways, sidewalks and yard, to focusing on difficult spots in your garage, patio and under trees and bushes, while Cruise Control provides optimal control with a steady stream for those larger areas. Tool free changes between blower and vacuum is done in seconds. A wide-mouth large capacity vacuum tube sucks up piles of leaves and debris, while the 10 to 1 mulching capacity takes 10 full bags of leaves and debris and mulches them into 1 bag of finely chopped mulch, and an easy-to-empty reusable large capacity leaf bag saves you time and effort. This lightweight blower is ideal for clearing driveways, sidewalks, decks, patios and garages and the heavy-duty vacuum is ideal for vacuuming leaves, grass clippings, twigs, pine needles and other lawn debris. Attach the rolling nozzle, which glides over hard surfaces, for quick and thorough clean up of even gravel, sand and dust. Backed by a 2-year limited warranty. With the RM1300 Electric Blower Mulcher Vac not only will you have quality lawn equipment that is reliable, easy-to-use, and powerful, but with Remington, you will have a Yard Well Done.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61knFEyBJDL._AC_SL1205_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Remington","source_asin":"B007TWHZMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007TWHZMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007TWHZMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
