window.products.push({"id":649845,"name":"Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit, 6pcs Heavy Duty Professional Stainless Steel Carving Tools Set With 2 LED Candles & 10 Carving Stencils, Great for Hall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ySbLVYvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2021 NEW KESSCA Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kits & Tools Why Choose Our Halloween Pumpkin Carving Kit? If you've ever tried to carve a pumpkin with a regular kitchen knife, you probably know how arduous and inefficient it can be. KESSCA pumpkin carving kits are the easier and safer way to carve your pumpkin that will make the job so much easier. It provide the tools you need to etch, sculpt, and cut your way to a next-level design. So whether you're going for an elegant or an eerie pumpkin, the right tools for the job can make all the difference. How To Use: SCOOPER: Scrape the inside of the pumpkin to remove the pulp, seeds and strings. BIG SAW & SMALL SAW: Used to cut out the lid of your pumpkin and carve simple designs. The serrated edge will cut through the pumpkin skin and flesh with ease. SCRAPER: Detail scrape and clean up. ETCHING TOOL: Easily do detail chipping off and carving. DRILL --- Used for pattern transfer and fine details. LED CANDLE: Two LED lights included. Reusable and safer than real candles. Each of which will help you get the job done and create a seriously memorable set of outdoor Halloween decorations while you're at it. 10 pumpkin carving stickers are also provided for giving you guidelines around which to carve. Pumpkin Carving Set Package Included: 6 × Heavy-Duty Stainless Steel Cutting & Carving Tools 10 × Halloween Pattern Stickers 2 × Pumpkin LED Candle 1 × Pumpkin Carving Kit Zippered Storage Case Warning: These pumpkin carving tool kits are sharp, so this set would be best suited to older kids under supervision. Our premium carving kits to take your pumpkin to the next level. So go ahead – carve out some time with your family and friends this Halloween!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715ySbLVYvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEESCA","source_asin":"B09B3KPZB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3KPZB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3KPZB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649846,"name":"Vinyl Record Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cgHHzhy8L._AC_SL1212_.jpg","description":"Wait until you see one actually hanging on a wall, unbelievably gorgeous! We have over 200 designs, so if you don't see what you like, just ask! And if we don't have it, talk to us about custom ordering something for a very fair price. An *American* made and cut vinyl album clock cut with precision to make the most unique gift or decoration imaginable. These are made with authentic 12 inch vinyl LP's(albums) with a new decorative label applied in the center and a clock that is completely silent (no tic toc here)! It is battery operated and takes only one AA battery. A built in hangar on the back of the clock mechanism makes it as simple as possible to hang. We have many designs so if you don't see something you are looking for, just ask! We will custom make designs too so don't be afraid to ask for anything, whether it be for your business, wedding, hobby or simply adding a name, etc. extremely unique and personal! The style/shape of the clock hands may vary from the picture, but the color will remain the same. ***Please keep in mind these are made from used, authentic 12 inch vinyl albums, and although we seriously try to use ones that are as new looking as possible, there can be blemishes or small scratches etc. Don't let this scare you, our final product quality is top notch! **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cgHHzhy8L._AC_SL1212_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Time Vault Treasures","source_asin":"B0799RNKJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0799RNKJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0799RNKJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":649847,"name":"Brentwood Mini Cupcake Maker Machine Non-Stick, 7, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3tl7Z8fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use the powerful 750 watt Brentwood TS-252 Non-Stick Mini Cupcake Maker Machine to bake 7 perfect mini cupcakes in just a few minutes. We’ve included recipes for vanilla, chocolate and carrot cupcakes, blueberry, bran, pumpkin spice and corn bread muffins, brownie and blondie bites. Easily slide your mini cupcakes out of the non-stick plates. Power and pre heat indicator lights inform you when the plates are hot and ready. Vertical feet and cable wrap allow the unit to stand upright for incredibly small storage. For safety, the mini cupcake maker will automatically shut off if it senses overheating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S3tl7Z8fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood","source_asin":"B00JS3KP64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JS3KP64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JS3KP64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
