window.products.push({"id":649981,"name":"SUPERIOR Ultra-Soft Microfiber Sheet Set - Full, Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zHi8hvc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens Superior proudly introduces our beautifully embroidered microfiber sheet sets, available in a variety of sizes and wide assortment of soft to bold solid colors. Our premium microfiber fabric is brushed on one side to ensure exceptional softness, breathability and wrinkle resistance, for a sheet set that is softer and more beautiful than jersey cotton, at a lower price. These beautiful sheets feature a smooth soft look, and the intricate 3-line infinity embroidery is the perfect subtle accent. The matching pillowcases are cleverly made with an envelope-style closure to keep oversized or overstuffed pillows neatly inside.  Available in 15 gorgeous colors and 6 sizes, these silky soft sheet and pillowcase sets are sure to become household favorites. Coordinate with our matching duvet cover sets, extra pillowcase sets in both standard and king, and bed skirts for a fantastic put together look that will make it incredibly hard to get out of bed in the morning. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, to towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zHi8hvc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B072C2N1CP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-649981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072C2N1CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072C2N1CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
